      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1893-05-06_WidnesExaminer_art0020" n="art0020">
        <head>creethis Yew-a-A:</head>
        <p>creethis Yew-a-A:</p>
        <p>GIVE BASH &amp; COMFORT DURING TEETHING. Pleasant, Cooling Aperient for Children of all Ages. Try them and prove their value for yourselves. Sold everywhere in paekets. Is. lid. and 23. 9d., or post 14 or 54 stamps. 7. PRITCHARD, CHEMIST, BEADLE. MANCHESTER (late Charlton Road).</p>
