        <p>1 0. M. R. W. 0. M. R. W. &amp;Wit l4 6 34 0 Nash S M Crosfield 14 5 34 1 Tonge 8 2 13 1 J 4 Crosfield ... 13 4 22 2 Hill R Smith lB 6 34 3 Bibby BEWSZY FORGE ENGINEERS Y. WALKERS BREWERY IST TRAMS.—This match was played on the Arpley ground on Saturday. The Engineers had good batting from T. Davey, who scored 14 and was well supported by W. and John Armitage. The innings realised 44 runs. Todd came out in good relief against Davey for the Brewery taking 14 runs in good form ; Tilling came next with seven runs. The following are the full scores : EsGINEERS. t BREWERY, R Davey b Todd 0 E Allen c and b T W Mee b Tilling 3 Davey T Davey c Tilling b Cain l4 J Arbour b T Davey 0 C Llewellyn b Tilling 3 Armitage b Todd 3 R Davey 1 J Barton a Cain b Todd 0 P Todd b T Davey W Armitage (mid) b Allen.:. 4 J Cain b T Davey 0 Jno Armitage c Cain b Till- H Green b R Davey 0 ing 6 J Tilling run out 7 0 Lewis c Cain b Green 2 W Rose c Llewellyn blt 3 Hartman not out J Boltou not out 0 F Higings c Joe Armi- tage b It Davey 0 Extras lO Extras 4</p>
