        <p>LIVERPOOL SPRING ASSIZES. 1893. The Commissions for holding these Assizes, will be Opened at LIVERPOOL, on SATURDAY, the Bth May. The Court will sit on MONDAY, the 90; ~f May, at 11 o'clock a.m., and on eve, y other day during the assizes at 10 o'clock am,, unless otherwise directed. Bail cases will be taken at these Assizes. The Prosecutors and Witnesses in the after-mentioned cases are required to be in attendance at the times specified in tha following List, and not earlier; and on all snip quent days, at the sitting of the Court ; and the trials are to pro- ceed in the order in which the Cases are arranged in the List, unless the Court eh tit otherwise direct, viz On TUESDAY, the 9th May, at 11 o'clock a.m. The Queen versus Ernest Pringe, forgery ; George Ellis and another, burglary ; Joshua Garbutt, attempting to murder ; John Mason, attemeting to carnally knew a girl ; William Blackburn. burglary ; Thomas Russell, robbery; Henry Mil- ler. wounding; Arthur Frank Lowe, carnally knowin4 a girl; Edward Riley. wounding ; George McAleavey, wounding ; James Donovan. robbery; Mary Sweeney, concealment of birth ; Frederick Willcox, arson ; John Kelly, wounding ; George Melbourne Harrison, bigamy ; Patrick McDonough, wounding ;Thomas Roi hwell. burglary ; Thomas Maguire and others, warehousebreaking ; Henry Birchen, indecent assault ; James Lavender, murder ; Owen O'Dwyer and another, larceny ; John Brennan, shopbreaking ; Charles Jeffreys, larceny; Helena Underwood, concealment. of birth ; Christopher Daley, wounding; Mary Ann Pagan and another manslaughter ; Elizabeth Baxter, burglary; James Unsworth murder ; Robert Gay, murder ; John Jameson, wounding. And all other cases. The foregoing regulations will be strictly enforced, and per- sons making default in the observance of them will be liable to have their costs disallowed. HERBERT STEPHEN. Clerk of Assize. Office of Clerk of Assize. Preston, 4th May, 1893. NB.—lt is particularly requested that all Depositions, nqu'sitions, and Recognisances may be IMMEDIATELY for- warded to me. at, Preston.</p>
